{"hw":"δεινός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δεινός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δεινός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, (<span class=\"gk\">δέος,</span> cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">La.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">198b</span> </span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fearful, terrible;</b> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, of persons and things, <span class=\"gk\">Χάρυβδις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.260</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κλαγγή</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.49</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅπλα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.254</span> </span>: freq. in neut., <span class=\"gk\">δεινὸν ἀῧσαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.10</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">βροντᾶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.56</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεινὸν δέρκεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.342</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">παπταίνειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.608</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεινὰ δ' ὑποδρὰ ἰδών</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.13</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. ἰδέσθαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fearful</b> to behold, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.405</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. μὲν ὁρᾶν, δ. δὲ κλύειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">141</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰ καὶ δεινόν τῳ ἀκοῦσαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.122</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεινὴ παρὰ τοῖς εἰδόσιν ἡ βάσανος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.30</span> </span>; in milder sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">awful,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δεινή τε καὶ αἰδοίη θεός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.394</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.172</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.22</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ δεινόν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">danger, suffering, horror,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">634</span> </span>, etc.; <b class=\"lex-tr\">awe, terror,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">517</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅπου τὸ δ. ἐλπὶς οὐδὲν ὠφελεῖ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">196</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς τὸ δ. ἔρχεσθαι</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">351</span> </span>: in pl., <span class=\"gk\">ἐκτὸς ὄντα πημάτων τὰ δείν' ὁρᾶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">504</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰ δείν