lass=\"lex-cite-title\">AJ</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.9.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεινόν τι ἔσχε αὐτὸν ἀτιμάζεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.61</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεινὸν</span> or <span class=\"gk\">δεινὰ παθεῖν</span> suffer <b class=\"lex-tr\">illegal, arbitrary</b> treatment, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">252</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">317b</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">δεινότερα π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.13</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ δ. τὸ πείσομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.11</span> </span>: in Oratt., <span class=\"gk\">δεινὸν ἂν εἴη εἰ..</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.30</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.88</span> </span>, etc. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-νῶς, φέρειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.121</span> </span>. <span class=\"gk\">γ'; δ. καὶ ἀπόρως ἔχει μοι</span> I am in <b class=\"lex-tr\">dire</b> straits, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. ἔχειν τῇ ἐνδείᾳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.4.23</span> </spa