scope\">298</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">δ. λέγεις πρᾶγμα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Euthd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">298c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. γ' εἶπας, εἰ καὶ ζῇς θανών</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1127</span> </span>; freq. <span class=\"gk\">δεινὸν ἂν εἴη εἰ..</span> it were <b class=\"lex-tr\">strange</b> that.., as <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hec.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">592</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-νῶς</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">marvellously, exceedingly,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δ. μέλαινα, ἄνυδρος,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.76</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">149</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. ἐν φυλακῇσι εἶναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.152</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. πώς εἰμ' ἐπιλήσμων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Metag.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2</span> </span>, etc.: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-οτέρως</span> Sch. Min.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.97</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">clever, skilful,</b> first in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.23</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀνὴρ δ. τε καὶ σοφός;</span> of Odysseus, <span class=\"gk\