e-scope\">34</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dionys.Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5</span> </span>, etc.: Cyren., = ποδανιπτήρ, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philet.</span> </span> ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.467d</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">a dance,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Apolloph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">threshing-floor,</b> Telesilla <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">instrument for making</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">gilding pills,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Schwyzer</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">182a</span> </span>.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span> (Gortyn, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">v/iv B.C.</span>).</div></div>"}